1
00:00:25,170 --> 00:00:29,330
[Live Forever]

2
00:00:30,530 --> 00:00:32,920
[Episode 10]

3
00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:39,430
Eloping sounds like a TV plot,

4
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:40,920
but back then,

5
00:00:41,150 --> 00:00:43,030
we really weren't afraid of anything,
not even death.

6
00:00:43,030 --> 00:00:44,110
I see.

7
00:00:45,670 --> 00:00:46,790
I see.

8
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:55,250
Dr... Dr. Xie.

9
00:00:58,070 --> 00:00:59,030
Are you okay?

10
00:01:01,640 --> 00:01:02,520
I'm sorry.

11
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:04,879
I lost my composure just now.

12
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:07,510
I was moved by your story.

13
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:09,430
Let's continue.

14
00:01:10,870 --> 00:01:11,510
So,

15
00:01:12,150 --> 00:01:13,789
that memory just now

16
00:01:13,789 --> 00:01:15,920
was when you loved each other the most.

17
00:01:29,039 --> 00:01:29,870
I suppose so.

18
00:01:37,350 --> 00:01:39,150
Let's go back to the beginning.

19
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,590
Your initial question was

20
00:01:42,150 --> 00:01:45,210
how to make the other person
fall in love with you again.

21
00:01:45,710 --> 00:01:47,440
After awakening the memories,

22
00:01:47,590 --> 00:01:50,000
we need to find your core conflict.

23
00:01:50,509 --> 00:01:52,680
The one who created the problem
must be the one to solve it.

24
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:53,950
I just don't know

25
00:01:54,590 --> 00:01:57,680
what your biggest unresolved issue is.

26
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:29,210
You can't sleep?

27
00:02:30,079 --> 00:02:31,200
No, I fell asleep.

28
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:32,710
I'll go

29
00:02:33,280 --> 00:02:35,470
see if Yu Tu is asleep.

30
00:02:36,850 --> 00:02:37,940
She wants a drink.

31
00:02:40,870 --> 00:02:41,870
You can't sleep?

32
00:02:46,590 --> 00:02:47,560
Yes.

33
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:49,240
Have a drink?

34
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:03,840
I'm sorry.

35
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:05,400
I sprayed it on you again.

36
00:03:07,850 --> 00:03:09,340
I know you too well.

37
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:21,200
-Why can't you sleep?
-Why can't you sleep?

38
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:26,870
My mind is a mess.

39
00:03:44,010 --> 00:03:45,329
I wish you hadn't

40
00:03:46,170 --> 00:03:47,400
saved me back then.

41
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:53,490
In Southern Qin,

42
00:03:54,790 --> 00:03:56,420
if you hadn't meddled

43
00:03:57,150 --> 00:03:58,190
and just left me in that courtyard...

44
00:03:58,190 --> 00:03:59,750
So what if I meddled?

45
00:04:00,300 --> 00:04:01,760
I would have saved anyone.

46
00:04:09,620 --> 00:04:11,020
But if I had to do it again,

47
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:17,000
I wouldn't want it to be anyone else.

48
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:34,159
Ning Changyue.

49
00:04:42,190 --> 00:04:43,120
Do you dare

50
00:04:49,310 --> 00:04:52,120
to go out and buy me some osmanthus cake?

51
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:55,600
Just that?

52
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:57,870
I thought you were going
to ask for the moon.

53
00:04:57,870 --> 00:04:58,530
Wait for me.

54
00:05:07,270 --> 00:05:09,070
Then do you dare

55
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:13,120
to sell all the things

56
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:14,750
you've collected?

57
00:05:32,190 --> 00:05:32,680
Hello,

58
00:05:32,950 --> 00:05:33,600
Wu Ya.

59
00:05:34,070 --> 00:05:34,630
Uncle.

60
00:05:34,710 --> 00:05:35,970
Sell all the things ...

61
00:05:38,830 --> 00:05:39,310
Hello?

62
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:40,430
What's up?

63
00:05:42,270 --> 00:05:42,870
Uncle?

64
00:05:45,150 --> 00:05:45,950
Nothing.

65
00:05:46,409 --> 00:05:48,490
You know the little cat we keep at home

66
00:05:48,510 --> 00:05:49,750
is very naughty.

67
00:05:50,300 --> 00:05:52,360
She accidentally pressed the phone.

68
00:05:53,830 --> 00:05:54,690
I'm hanging up.

69
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:57,630
Do we

70
00:05:58,159 --> 00:05:59,159
have a cat at home?

71
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:02,250
Any other requests,

72
00:06:02,550 --> 00:06:03,550
Your Highness?

73
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:18,460
Ning Changyue.

74
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:31,120
Do you dare to jump
off a cliff with me again?

75
00:06:34,100 --> 00:06:39,400
♪ My heart aches as if
it's tearing through my chest ♪

76
00:06:39,430 --> 00:06:44,010
♪ Shattered into pieces ♪

77
00:06:45,180 --> 00:06:50,020
♪ Until my lungs have nothing left ♪

78
00:06:51,970 --> 00:06:57,420
♪ I'll kill the beauty that kept me awake ♪

79
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:55,750
Are you ready?

80
00:06:58,060 --> 00:07:02,800
♪ I'll kill the beauty that kept me awake ♪

81
00:06:59,630 --> 00:07:00,800
From now on,

82
00:07:01,270 --> 00:07:02,820
whether in heaven or on earth,

83
00:07:02,820 --> 00:07:09,830
♪ I'll kill the beauty that kept me awake ♪

84
00:07:03,270 --> 00:07:04,390
you and I

85
00:07:05,070 --> 00:07:06,200
will never be apart.

86
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:13,750
We are still alive.

87
00:07:14,630 --> 00:07:16,630
My leg feels like it's broken.

88
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:19,720
Is it because of that pill?

89
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:24,920
Hey, Song Yiqiu.

90
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:26,380
Are you busy right now?

91
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:28,850
Why didn't you come looking for me?

92
00:07:29,360 --> 00:07:32,430
I've waited for you
for 72 years and 37 days.

93
00:07:32,430 --> 00:07:34,040
Wait for me. Don't rush.

94
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:36,430
Why didn't you come looking for me?

95
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:39,240
I really can't die.

96
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:40,430
Try stabbing me.

97
00:07:43,510 --> 00:07:45,190
It hurts!

98
00:07:50,430 --> 00:07:52,270
What did you mean
by raising a cat just now?

99
00:07:52,270 --> 00:07:53,070
Why bother getting a cat?

100
00:07:53,070 --> 00:07:54,120
They might as well raise me.

101
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:54,920
Go away.

102
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:59,310
We are not monsters.

103
00:07:59,720 --> 00:08:00,270
Go away.

104
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:01,800
Go away.

105
00:08:02,630 --> 00:08:03,510
Go away!

106
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:06,600
Oh my God.

107
00:08:07,500 --> 00:08:08,630
Go away.

108
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:17,120
Song Yiqiu.

109
00:08:20,270 --> 00:08:22,430
Can I come to see you?

110
00:08:41,770 --> 00:08:42,750
Am I crazy?

111
00:08:43,280 --> 00:08:44,480
Do I have a death wish?

112
00:08:50,870 --> 00:08:52,730
How am I supposed to explain this?

113
00:09:06,750 --> 00:09:07,880
There's still time.

114
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:09,270
Do it now.

115
00:09:55,900 --> 00:09:57,500
Let's take care of business.

116
00:10:23,220 --> 00:10:24,280
What are you doing?

117
00:10:32,790 --> 00:10:33,840
It's not working.

118
00:10:55,470 --> 00:10:56,080
Freeze!

119
00:11:03,200 --> 00:11:04,670
Look at you.

120
00:11:04,670 --> 00:11:06,630
Be careful with my sapling.

121
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:08,080
Okay.

122
00:11:09,670 --> 00:11:10,720
I have to say,

123
00:11:12,110 --> 00:11:14,940
your trick is quite practical.

124
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:16,130
Of course.

125
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:17,440
I can stop time,

126
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:18,750
control people's minds,

127
00:11:18,750 --> 00:11:21,320
and even erase memories.

128
00:11:21,910 --> 00:11:22,620
Why else do you think

129
00:11:22,620 --> 00:11:24,750
Ning Changyue wanted to learn from me?

130
00:11:26,510 --> 00:11:27,150
Then...

131
00:11:28,790 --> 00:11:29,600
Well...

132
00:11:30,270 --> 00:11:31,510
When did that happen?

133
00:11:32,950 --> 00:11:33,920
Let me think.

134
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:41,000
I don't remember.

135
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:42,270
Anyway.

136
00:11:43,240 --> 00:11:45,390
He learned it because of you.

137
00:11:47,510 --> 00:11:48,630
Because of me?

138
00:11:52,670 --> 00:11:54,790
Did you learn from Yu Tu because of me?

139
00:12:08,360 --> 00:12:09,840
Actually, I just wanted to

140
00:12:11,510 --> 00:12:13,440
solve these problems thoroughly.

141
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:17,030
Maybe then you wouldn't be angry.

142
00:12:29,870 --> 00:12:30,730
Ning Changyue.

143
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:34,870
Do you dare

144
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:40,920
to fall in love with me again?

145
00:12:42,800 --> 00:12:46,350
♪ You are my light, my reason why ♪

146
00:12:46,550 --> 00:12:50,110
♪ You shine upon the depths inside ♪

147
00:12:50,400 --> 00:12:51,930
♪ Because of you ♪

148
00:12:51,970 --> 00:12:55,390
♪ I finally learned ♪

149
00:12:55,520 --> 00:12:56,860
♪ To keep moving forward ♪

150
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:05,720
Hello, everyone.

151
00:13:06,040 --> 00:13:07,790
I moved a while ago, remember?

152
00:13:07,820 --> 00:13:10,820
Guess what I found in the old house.

153
00:13:10,840 --> 00:13:13,470
Miss Song, what are you doing?

154
00:13:13,840 --> 00:13:16,200
My grandmother's hidden treasure.

155
00:13:18,190 --> 00:13:18,920
Song Yiqiu,

156
00:13:19,460 --> 00:13:20,240
what are you doing?

157
00:13:20,240 --> 00:13:21,870
A Republic of China-era
marriage certificate.

158
00:13:21,870 --> 00:13:23,630
You probably won't find

159
00:13:23,650 --> 00:13:25,780
another one online in this condition.

160
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:26,750
Come on,

161
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:29,300
let's take a look at the format first.

162
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:31,980
Two families joined in marriage.

163
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:33,550
Bound together in matrimony.

164
00:13:33,550 --> 00:13:35,210
Bound together in matrimony.

165
00:13:36,910 --> 00:13:38,870
This opening is very classic.

166
00:13:39,270 --> 00:13:41,200
Let's continue reading.

167
00:13:41,400 --> 00:13:42,130
Let me see.

168
00:13:43,030 --> 00:13:45,630
Today, with these words written in red,

169
00:13:46,070 --> 00:13:48,000
our fates are bound by the red cord.

170
00:13:48,870 --> 00:13:50,850
I, Huai, sincerely

171
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:53,030
forge an eternal bond with you.

172
00:13:53,030 --> 00:13:54,760
Forge an eternal bond with you.

173
00:13:59,320 --> 00:14:01,320
I'll open it for everyone to see now.

174
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:05,320
May we know each other
through every season,

175
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:06,910
in warmth and cold alike.

176
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:08,720
May we share in all the joys

177
00:14:09,150 --> 00:14:10,630
that life has to offer.

178
00:14:11,520 --> 00:14:13,380
Let the sun and moon bear witness,

179
00:14:13,510 --> 00:14:15,370
and heaven and earth be our testament.

180
00:14:15,370 --> 00:14:16,770
If I betray your heart,

181
00:14:16,910 --> 00:14:18,240
I betray heaven itself.

182
00:14:18,840 --> 00:14:20,550
My heart shall never waver,

183
00:14:21,040 --> 00:14:22,640
nor shall I ever forsake you.

184
00:14:28,910 --> 00:14:30,080
Lin Huai.

185
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:31,520
Baiwei,

186
00:14:33,150 --> 00:14:34,360
please marry me.

187
00:14:36,120 --> 00:14:37,360
Sworn by,

188
00:14:38,630 --> 00:14:39,720
Lin Huai.

189
00:14:41,080 --> 00:14:42,240
Song Baiwei.

190
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:48,670
Song Baiwei.

191
00:14:50,140 --> 00:14:51,690
Song Yiqiu.

192
00:14:56,410 --> 00:14:57,410
Is it you?

193
00:15:00,130 --> 00:15:01,450
Is it really you?

194
00:15:12,110 --> 00:15:15,070
♪ Longing flows on like water ♪

195
00:15:16,220 --> 00:15:19,210
♪ Through the turning nights and days ♪

196
00:15:20,030 --> 00:15:22,440
♪ I gaze upon your light ♪

197
00:15:22,470 --> 00:15:26,320
♪ And stay here, watching over you ♪

198
00:15:27,620 --> 00:15:30,650
♪ Longing carries through the years ♪

199
00:15:31,680 --> 00:15:34,400
♪ As fate turns back around ♪

200
00:15:35,430 --> 00:15:38,200
♪ If I could grow old with you ♪

201
00:15:38,220 --> 00:15:43,500
♪ This life would be enough ♪

202
00:16:04,710 --> 00:16:05,440
Where is he?

203
00:16:07,080 --> 00:16:08,410
Where is Ning Changyue?

204
00:16:09,240 --> 00:16:09,870
He...

205
00:16:10,320 --> 00:16:11,200
I don't know.

206
00:16:12,320 --> 00:16:14,180
Was it because things got awkward

207
00:16:14,550 --> 00:16:16,080
between you two yesterday?

208
00:16:20,220 --> 00:16:21,310
Go do your thing.

209
00:16:30,790 --> 00:16:31,480
Look,

210
00:16:33,110 --> 00:16:35,910
how did two more flowers appear overnight?

211
00:16:37,880 --> 00:16:38,640
Let me see.

212
00:16:43,800 --> 00:16:45,470
Could it be that once the flowers bloom,

213
00:16:45,470 --> 00:16:47,990
the Vow to Live Forever will be broken?

214
00:16:48,310 --> 00:16:50,020
What if you two suddenly

215
00:16:50,150 --> 00:16:52,030
grow old and lose your looks,

216
00:16:52,450 --> 00:16:55,740
while I'm the only one
who stays young and beautiful?

217
00:16:58,550 --> 00:17:00,080
Could it be that the shows
you've been watching lately

218
00:17:00,080 --> 00:17:02,340
are all about these manipulative girls?

219
00:17:03,470 --> 00:17:04,319
Yeah.

220
00:17:04,400 --> 00:17:05,349
My show,

221
00:17:05,349 --> 00:17:08,069
"The Manipulative Beauty
Tames the Crazy Prince",

222
00:17:08,069 --> 00:17:08,920
has updated.

223
00:17:09,040 --> 00:17:10,170
Then I'll get going.

224
00:17:11,510 --> 00:17:12,710
Time to watch my show.

225
00:17:21,099 --> 00:17:22,490
It seems this time,

226
00:17:22,960 --> 00:17:25,160
the eternal life is really going to end.

227
00:17:32,240 --> 00:17:33,310
Mr. Painting,

228
00:17:34,400 --> 00:17:35,790
or Mrs. Painting,

229
00:17:36,470 --> 00:17:39,120
can I ask you a favor?

230
00:17:39,140 --> 00:17:41,260
Regarding the frequency of this blooming,

231
00:17:41,260 --> 00:17:43,010
can we control it to

232
00:17:43,680 --> 00:17:44,830
once a week...

233
00:17:45,120 --> 00:17:45,830
No, no, no.

234
00:17:46,310 --> 00:17:47,910
Once a month.

235
00:17:48,310 --> 00:17:49,440
One flower at a time,

236
00:17:49,720 --> 00:17:50,270
okay?

237
00:17:50,780 --> 00:17:52,350
We need to take a scientific approach

238
00:17:52,350 --> 00:17:53,720
to flowering.

239
00:17:53,870 --> 00:17:55,220
Slow and steady.

240
00:17:55,350 --> 00:17:57,160
Quality

241
00:17:57,720 --> 00:17:58,790
over quantity.

242
00:17:59,510 --> 00:18:00,170
Sound good?

243
00:18:00,680 --> 00:18:01,440
Is it okay?

244
00:18:01,640 --> 00:18:03,440
Please, please, please.

245
00:18:04,030 --> 00:18:06,090
Please, just slow down the blooming.

246
00:18:14,640 --> 00:18:15,070
You...

247
00:18:15,680 --> 00:18:16,720
You, you, you...

248
00:18:17,080 --> 00:18:20,120
I tried to reason with you nicely,
but you wouldn't listen, would you?

249
00:18:20,120 --> 00:18:21,520
You're driving me crazy.

250
00:18:25,320 --> 00:18:27,670
That's fine.

251
00:18:33,480 --> 00:18:35,880
I'll bring you out
when you've calmed down.

252
00:18:38,100 --> 00:18:38,960
Ning Changyue.

253
00:18:52,930 --> 00:18:53,850
Lin Huai.
